msgstr "Company History"

msgid "companyHistory_txt"
msgstr "<p>Parent organization was founded in 1988 and after that check the success of the work and the multiplicity of activities emanated (Excellence Miles) to be more Specialized</p><p>The company aims at interior projects and services furnishing in accordance with the standards and levels of distinctive local and global perspective through the experience of its consultants.</p><p>Excellence miles has developed a new structure for events organization and conferences with the best human resources, technologies and services, based on its previous experience, in addition to research and development provided additional services, starting with design and implementation, engaged in the analysis and marketing of events and providing audio and visual services and catering.</p>"

msgid "chairman_message"
msgstr "Chairman’s Message"

msgid "chairman_message_txt"
msgstr "We have always worked to provide the best services to our clients and distinguished by our ability to develop and keep up with the modernity in the urban development witnessed by the Kingdom and we have expanded our business to cover all parts of the Kingdom.<br/>Was so thanks to God and then the efforts of your professional technical staff, where you have provided everything necessary to expand and achieve success with your specialization in the field of civil works, interior construction, decoration, furnishing and organization of events<br/>Therefore, I am pleased to be part of the group of independent entities specialized in the above mentioned activities to serve as a symbol of excellence for Events, a new service for our customers, keeping pace with the development of their business and providing the best possible to turn the imagination into reality and meet the needs of customers<br/>Honesty and honesty is the foundation of success, you must keep them to stay true to the trust we have entrusted to our customers and follow up diligently to customer requests and accuracy in the achievement always make you on the ladder of success<br/>"

